      "hash64": "1F43B59C75CDE306",
      "text": "Four",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_02",
      "hash64": "C44608AE4D4FFA84",
      "text": "2. True or false? You can get new Pokémon\\n    only by catching them yourself or trading\\n    with other Trainers.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_02a",
      "hash64": "1F3FD29C75CA2B76",
      "text": "True",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_02b",
      "hash64": "1F3FD19C75CA29C3",
      "text": "False",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_03",
      "hash64": "C44609AE4D4FFC37",
      "text": "3. If a Pokémon is holding an Everstone, will\\n    using an item that induces Evolution, such as\\n    a Fire Stone, cause it to evolve?\\n\\nA) Yes, it will\\nB) No, it won’t",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_03a",
      "hash64": "1F3CAE9C75C7B873",
      "text": "A) Yes, it will",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_03b",
      "hash64": "1F3CAF9C75C7BA26",
      "text": "B) No, it won’t",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_04",
      "hash64": "C44606AE4D4FF71E",
      "text": "4. What is the probability of running into a\\n    Shiny Pokémon?\\n\\nA) 1 in 2,000\\nB) 1 in 4,000\\nC) 1 in 6,000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04a",
      "hash64": "1F54B69C75DC57EC",
      "text": "A) 1 in 2,000",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04b",
      "hash64": "1F54B99C75DC5D05",
      "text": "B) 1 in 4,000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_04c",
      "hash64": "1F54B89C75DC5B52",
      "text": "C) 1 in 6,000",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_05",
      "hash64": "C44607AE4D4FF8D1",
      "text": "5. True or false? The Pokémon known as Oricorio\\n    has three forms.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_05a",
      "hash64": "1F50D29C75D89EA9",
      "text": "True",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_05b",
      "hash64": "1F50CF9C75D89990",
      "text": "False",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_06",
      "hash64": "C44604AE4D4FF3B8",
      "text": "—This question won’t affect your grade!—\\n\\nDo you have anything you would like to say\\nabout my class? I’m still getting used to this\\nteaching thing, but I sure had fun as your teacher!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06a",
      "hash64": "1F4DEA9C75D6919A",
      "text": "It was fun!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06b",
      "hash64": "1F4DE99C75D68FE7",
      "text": "Thank you for being our teacher!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06c",
      "hash64": "1F4DE89C75D68E34",
      "text": "Keep teaching! You can do it!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_a_08_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "E6120BA4A4133FA4",
      "text": "OK! Time’s up whether you like it or not! I hope\\neveryone enjoyed tackling those questions![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
